1141, 31145-31146, 31150, 31156, 31192-31193, 31195-31196, 39901 Area codes 404 / 678/770/470/943 FIPS code 13-04000 [12] GNIS feature ID 351615 [11] Website discoveratlanta Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter blank1_info . Replace with custom_data1_sec1 . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter blank_name . Replace with custom_label_sec1 . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated par', '["clm_wiki_atlanta_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
