  ('cs_portland_history', 'plc_portland', 'overview', 'History',
   'Most populous city in Oregon, U.S. html body This article may be too long to read and navigate comfortably . When this tag was added, its readable prose size was 12200 words. Consider condensing it or adding subheadings . Please discuss this issue on the article''s talk page . ( April 2026 ) City in Oregon, United States Portland City Downtown Portland with Mount Hood in the background St. Johns Bridge Oregon Convention Center Union Station and U.S. Bancorp Tower Pioneer Courthouse Square Tilikum Crossing Flag Seal Nicknames: "Rose City"; "Stumptown"; "PDX"; see Nicknames of Portland, Oregon for a complete list. Mottoes: "The City that Works" [1] Interactive map of Portland Portland Location within Oregon Show map of Oregon Portland Location within the United States Show map of the United States Coordinates: 45°31′12″N 122°40′55″W &#xfeff; / &#xfeff; 45.52000°N 122.68194°W &#xfeff; / 45.52000; -122.68194 Country United States State Oregon Counties Multnomah Washington Clackamas Founded 1845 &#59;&#32;181 years ago ( 1845 ) Incorporated February 8, 1851 &#59;&#32;175 years ago ( 1851-02-08 ) Named after Portland, Maine [3] Government • Type Mayor–council government • Body Portland City Council • Mayor Keith Wilson ( D ) • Auditor Simone Rede [2] Area [4] • City 145.00 sq mi (375.55 km 2 ) • Land 133.49 sq mi (345.73 km 2 ) • Water 11.51 sq mi (29.82 km 2 ) • Urban 519.30 sq mi (1,345.0 km 2 ) Elevation [5] 161 ft (49 m) Highest elevation [6] 1,188 ft (362 m) Lowest elevation [7] &#32;( Columbia River ) 0.62 ft (0.19 m) Population ( 2020 ) [8] • City 652,503 • Estimate (2025) [9] 635,109 • Rank 74th in North America 28th in the United States 1st in Oregon • Density 4,888/sq mi (1,887.3/km 2 ) • Urban 2,104,238 ( US: 23rd ) • Urban density 4,052/sq mi (1,564.5/km 2 ) • Metro [10] 2,511,612 ( US: 25th ) Demonym Portlander GDP [11] • Metro $218.894 billion (2023) Time zone UTC– 08:00 ( PST ) • Summer ( DST ) UTC– 07:00 ( PDT ) ZIP Codes 97086, 97201-97225, 97227-97233, 97236, 97238-97240, 97242, 97250-97254, 97256, 97266-97269, 97280-97283, 97286, 97290-97294, 97296, 97298 Area codes 503 and 971 FIPS code 41-59000 GNIS ID 2411471 [5] Website portland Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter blank1_info . Replace with custom_data1_sec1 . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter blank_info . Replace with custom_data_sec1 . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with ', '["clm_wiki_portland_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
