  ('cs_baton-rouge_overview', 'plc_baton-rouge', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Baton Rouge is the capital city of the U.S. state of Louisiana. It had a population of 227,470 at the 2020 United States census, making it Louisiana''s second-most populous city. It is the seat of Louisiana''s most populous parish, East Baton Rouge Parish, and the center of Louisiana''s second-largest metropolitan area, Greater Baton Rouge, which had 870,569 residents in 2020.', '["clm_wiki_baton-rouge_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'place_sections_v2', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
