VALUES
  ('cs_wichita_history', 'plc_wichita', 'overview', 'History',
   'City in Kansas, U.S. Not to be confused with Wichita County, Kansas . City in Kansas, United States Wichita, Kansas City Downtown Wichita skyline (2023) Carey House Exploration Place science museum Flag Seal Logo Nicknames: Air Capital of the World, [1] ICT [2] Interactive map of Wichita, Kansas Wichita Location within Kansas Show map of Kansas Wichita Location within the United States Show map of the United States Coordinates: 37°41′20″N 97°20′10″W &#xfeff; / &#xfeff; 37.68889°N 97.33611°W &#xfeff; / 37.68889; -97.33611 [3] Country United States State Kansas County Sedgwick Founded 1868 Incorporated 1870 Named after Wichita people Government • Type Council–manager • Mayor Lily Wu ( L ) • City Manager Dennis Marstall Area [4] • City 166.52 sq mi (431.28 km 2 ) • Land 161.99 sq mi (419.55 km 2 ) • Water 4.53 sq mi (11.73 km 2 ) Elevation [3] 1,303 ft (397 m) Population ( 2020 ) [5] [6] • City 397,532 • Estimate (2025) [7] 400,987 • Rank 52nd in the United States 1st in Kansas • Density 2,454.1/sq mi (947.52/km 2 ) • Urban 500,231 ( US: 84th ) • Urban density 2,205/sq mi (851.4/km 2 ) • Metro [8] 647,919 ( US: 93rd ) Demonym Wichitan Time zone UTC−6 ( CST ) • Summer ( DST ) UTC−5 (CDT) ZIP Codes 67201–67221, 67223, 67226–67228, 67230, 67232, 67235, 67260, 67275–67278 [9] Area code 316 FIPS code 20-79000 [3] GNIS ID 473862 [3] Website wichita Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter blank1_info . Replace with custom_data1_sec1 . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter timezone . Replace with time_zone . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter blank1_name . Replace with custom_label1_sec1 . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter blank_info . Replace with custom_data_sec1 . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter blank_name . Replace with custom_label_sec1 . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter settlement_type . Replace with type . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter timezone_DST . Replace with time_zone_DST . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox settlement with deprecated parameter image_skyline . Replace with image . Wichita ( / ˈ w ɪ tʃ ɪ t ɔː / &#32; ⓘ , WITCH -ih-taw ) [10] is the most populous city in the U.S. state of Kansas and the county seat of Sed', '["clm_wiki_wichita_history"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
