  ('cs_st-louis_overview', 'plc_st-louis', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'St. Louis is an independent city in the U.S. state of Missouri. It lies near the confluence of the Mississippi and the Missouri rivers. In 2020, the city proper had a population of 301,578, while its metropolitan area, which extends into Illinois, had an estimated population of over 2.8 million. It is the largest metropolitan area in Missouri and the second-largest in Illinois. The city''s combined statistical area is the 20th-largest in the United States.', '["clm_wiki_st-louis_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'place_sections_v2', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   10, 1, 1, unixepoch());
