  ('cs_walt-disney-world_overview', 'plc_walt-disney-world', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Walt Disney World Resort is an entertainment and vacation resort complex located about 20 miles (32 km) southwest of Orlando, Florida, United States. Opened on October 1, 1971, the resort is operated by Disney Experiences, a division of the Walt Disney Company.', '["clm_wiki_walt-disney-world_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
