VALUES
  ('cs_rock-and-roll-hall-of-fame_overview', 'plc_rock-and-roll-hall-of-fame', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'The Rock and Roll Hall of Fame (RRHOF), also simply referred to as the Rock Hall, is a museum and hall of fame located in downtown Cleveland, Ohio, United States, on the shore of Lake Erie. The museum documents the history of rock music and the artists, producers, engineers, and other personnel who have influenced its development.', '["clm_wiki_rock-and-roll-hall-of-fame_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'place_sections_v2', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
