   'Leland Stanford Junior University, commonly referred to as Stanford University, is a private research university in Stanford, California, United States. It was founded in 1885 by railroad magnate Leland Stanford and his wife, Jane, in memory of their only child, Leland Jr.', '["clm_wiki_stanford-university_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
