  ('cs_georgetown-university_overview', 'plc_georgetown-university', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Georgetown University is a private Jesuit research university in Washington, D.C., United States. Founded by Bishop John Carroll in 1789, it is the oldest Catholic institution of higher education in the United States, the oldest university in Washington, D.C., and the nation''s first federally chartered university.', '["clm_wiki_georgetown-university_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
