   'Tuskegee University is a private, historically black land-grant university in Tuskegee, Alabama, United States. It was founded as a normal school for black teachers on July 4, 1881, by the Alabama Legislature.', '["clm_wiki_tuskegee-university_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
