  ('cs_hampton-university_demographics', 'plc_hampton-university', 'overview', 'Demographics',
   'National Historic Landmark District United States historic place Hampton Institute U.S. National Register of Historic Places U.S. National Historic Landmark District Virginia Landmarks Register Location within Virginia Show map of Virginia Location within the United States Show map of the United States Location NW of jct. of U.S. 60 and the Hampton Roads Bridge Tunnel, Hampton, Virginia Coordinates 37°01′13″N 76°35′40″W &#xfeff; / &#xfeff; 37.0203°N 76.5945°W &#xfeff; / 37.0203; -76.5945 Area 314 acres (127 ha) Built 1866 ( 1866 ) Architect Richard Morris Hunt ; Et al. NRHP reference No. 69000323 [1] VLR No. 114-0006 Significant dates Added to NRHP November 12, 1969 Designated NHLD May 30, 1974 [3] Designated VLR September 9, 1969 [2] Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox NRHP with deprecated parameter refnum . Replace with ref_num . Preview warning: Page using Template:Infobox NRHP with deprecated parameter locmapin . Replace with pushpin_map . A 15-acre (61,000 m 2 ) portion of the campus along the Hampton River, including many of the older buildings, is a U.S. National Historic Landmark District . Buildings included are: Mansion House, original plantation residence of Little Scotland Virginia Hall, built in 1873 Academic Hall Wigwam Marquand Memorial Chapel, a Romanesque Revival red brick chapel with a 150-foot (46 m) tower In addition, Cleveland Hall, Ogden, and the Administration building are also included in the district. [4] The district was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1969 and declared a National Historic Landmark in 1974. [5] [4] ^ body:not( ):not( ) "National Register Information System – (&#35;69000323)" . National Register of Historic Places . National Park Service . July 9, 2010. ^ "Virginia Landmarks Register" . Virginia Department of Historic Resources. Archived from the original on September 21, 2013 . Retrieved March 19, 2013 . ^ "Hampton Institute" . National Historic Landmark summary listing . National Park Service', '["clm_wiki_hampton-university_demographics"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
