   'Williams College is a private liberal arts college in Williamstown, Massachusetts, United States. It was established as a men''s college in 1793 with funds from the estate of Ephraim Williams, a colonist from the Province of Massachusetts Bay who was killed in the French and Indian War in 1755.', '["clm_wiki_williams-college_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
