  ('cs_mount-holyoke-college_overview', 'plc_mount-holyoke-college', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'Mount Holyoke College is a private women''s liberal arts college in South Hadley, Massachusetts, United States. It is the oldest member of the historic Seven Sisters colleges, a group of historically women''s colleges in the Northeastern United States. The college was founded in 1837 as the Mount Holyoke Female Seminary by Mary Lyon, a pioneer in education for women. Mount Holyoke is part of the Five College Consortium in Western Massachusetts.', '["clm_wiki_mount-holyoke-college_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
