VALUES
  ('cs_mahatma-gandhi-death_overview', 'ent_mahatma-gandhi-death', 'overview', 'Overview',
   'New Delhi is the capital city of India and a part of the National Capital Territory of Delhi (NCT). New Delhi is the seat of all three branches of the Government of India, hosting the Rashtrapati Bhavan, Sansad Bhavan, and the Supreme Court. New Delhi is a municipality within the NCT, administered by the New Delhi Municipal Council (NDMC), which covers mostly Lutyens'' Delhi and a few adjacent areas. The municipal area is part of a larger administrative district, the New Delhi district.', '["clm_wiki_mahatma-gandhi-death_overview"]', '["src_en_wikipedia"]',
   'general', 'en', 'assisted', 'place_sections_v2', 'auto_approved', 1, unixepoch(), unixepoch(),
   10, 1, 1, unixepoch());
